しては、天然さと男心への疎さから気があると勘違いさせる言動が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親しみやすいので告白される回数ナンバーワンだが、極度の天然でお友達と解釈され、男子はみな玉砕している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"205376"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6ee6c9dcdef16a8164e80476c2307c538d7914b27972b0c4c755af700affe095.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/4729972f685617c17e8f65d8cadcb27d05a943e7e412cc764a715f433d6c1744.webp","width":129,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南月悠奈","creatorId":"vndb:s692","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s692","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s692","name":"水瀬 沙季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:223589:205376:6349:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29123","characterName":"城山 咲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"205381","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"223589"},{"characterId":"205381","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"223917"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5413"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29123"},"originalCharacterName":"城山 咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Feared by the boys. Admired by the girls. She is bossy and harsh, but is also very good-looking. Despite looking scary, she is an ally of the girls and they look up to her as an older sister. She dislikes crooked and vile things. She is admired by many men, but since her boyfriend is the boss of the a gang, they are struck silence. Dating Saki is considered the boss's medal."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29123"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"短気でがさつながら、鬼神の如き強さと美しさを持つヤンキー女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗で女らしい肉体をしているが、かなりの実力者であり、県内最強の不良であり、恐れられつつもファンは多く、姉御やお姉様として崇拝されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一時期の美人すぎるブームの時に、マスコミが取材に来たこともあるほどの有名人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5413","sourceWorkId":"17106","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子からは恐れられ女子からは憧れられるヤンキータイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝気で喧嘩っぱ早いが男前でキツめだが容姿も端麗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怖いが女子の味方、曲がった事は嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｍ気があり主人公に堕されてからは、Ｍ系プレイにどんどんハマっていくドスケベマゾタイプ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5413","sourceWorkId":"17417","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子からは恐れられ女子からは憧れられるヤンキータイプ。 勝気でキツめだが容姿も端麗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見怖いが女子の味方で、姉御と慕われている。 曲がったことは嫌いで筋は通す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は男たちの間では咲を彼女にしたいという者も多いが、咲が不良グループのボスと付き合っているため誰も怖くて言い出せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"咲を手に入れることは男の勲章と不良たちの間では見られている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"205381"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8c372798f4438ddad3858cb398f75caac5b022d1cfd2bbbf540e1e089ecf5ca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a76ed77c39e327a4be7e94f9ab53e0f0753291ab07d31fcafbf416ae78dd021.webp","width":114,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"霧島はるな","creatorId":"vndb:s2698","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2698","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2698","name":"霧島はるな(水無月じゅん)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:223589:205381:13771:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p918","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2797","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p918","name":"Miel","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:17106:2797","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p918","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p918","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p918","name":"Miel","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"ident